OUTPUT2  KGG,PG,KLL,PL,//0/11 $  
ENDALTER $   
CEND                                                                            
$
$ --- Case Control Deck ---
$
TITLE    = CANTILEVER BEAM WITH MATRIX EXPORT (L=1.0m, 10 ELMTS)                
SUBTITLE = NASTRAN DEMONSTRATION PROBLEM NO. D01-01-3A                          
LABEL    = LOAD ON TRAILING EDGE                                                
     SPC = 1                                                                    
    LOAD = 3                                                                    
OUTPUT                                                                          
        SET 1 = 1 THRU 11                                                       
   DISPLACEMENTS = ALL                                                          
BEGIN BULK                                                                      
$                                                                               
$ --- Bulk Data Deck ---                                                        
$                                                                               
$ --- Grid Points (11 nodes for 10 elements) ---                                
$ The beam is 1m long, so elements are 0.1m long.                               
$ Node 1 is at x=0.0, Node 11 is at x=1.0.                                      
$ Nodes must be in the basic coordinate system (0).                             
$1-8    9-16    17-24   25-32   33-40   41-48   49-56   57-64                   
GRID    1               0.0     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    2               0.1     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    3               0.2     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    4               0.3     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    5               0.4     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    6               0.5     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    7               0.6     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    8               0.7     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    9               0.8     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    10              0.9     0.0     0.0                                     
GRID    11              1.0     0.0     0.0                                     
$                                                                               
$ --- Element Connectivity (CBAR) ---                                           
$ Connects nodes 1-2, 2-3, ..., 10-11                                           
$1-8    9-16    17-24   25-32   33-40   41-48   49-56   57-64                   
CBAR    1       1       1       2       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    2       1       2       3       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    3       1       3       4       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    4       1       4       5       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    5       1       5       6       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    6       1       6       7       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    7       1       7       8       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    8       1       8       9       0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    9       1       9       10      0.0     1.0     0.0                     
CBAR    10      1       10      11      0.0     1.0     0.0                     
$                                                                               
$ --- Material Properties (MAT1: Steel) ---                                     
MAT1    1       2.0E11          0.3     7850.0                                  
$                                                                               
$ --- Element Properties (PBAR) ---                                             
$ Assuming steel material properties                                            
$  A, I1, I2, J, NSM (unit cross-section)                                       
PBAR    1       1       1.0E-4  1.0E-8  1.0E-8  1.0E-8  1.0E-8                  
$                                                                               
$ --- Boundary Conditions (SPC) ---                                             
$ Cantilever: Fix all 6 DOFs (123456) at Node 1 (fixed support)                 
SPC     1       1       123456  0.0                                             
$                                                                               
$ --- Loading (FORCE) ---                                                       
$ 1000 N downward force at the free end (Node 11) in the Z-direction            
$ (Component 3)                                                                 
$1-8    9-16    17-24   25-32   33-40   41-48   49-56   57-64                   
FORCE   2       11      0       500.0   0.0     1.0     0.0                     
FORCE   3       11      0       500.0   0.0     0.0     1.0                     
ENDDATA                                                                         
